{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Exorcist",
    "steam_appid": 3364650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you take on the role of a exorcist to complete a ritual. As the spirits struggle and various sinister disruptions arise, you must hold your ground until the ritual is complete and successfully banish them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Duration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose your game duration at the start:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 minutes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Duration selection does not affect achievement unlocking.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spirit Pursuit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wandering vengeful ghosts will attempt to capture you, testing your courage and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toy Destruction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirit-controlled dolls will try to sabotage the barrier\u2014you must act quickly to stop them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Disruptions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of minor and major disturbances keep the tension and challenge levels high.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Free Focus</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pure game-play experience that dives straight into the core fun.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modes &amp; Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster stamina recovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one doll on the field, reducing difficulty.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers additional collection achievements for hardcore players seeking deeper satisfaction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore two distinct maps, each with unique styles and experiences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move</strong>: WADS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run</strong>: Left Shift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crouch</strong>: C</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate/Interact</strong>: Left Mouse Button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exit Investigation</strong>: Right Mouse Button</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you take on the role of a exorcist to complete a ritual. As the spirits struggle and various sinister disruptions arise, you must hold your ground until the ritual is complete and successfully banish them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Duration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose your game duration at the start:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 minutes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Duration selection does not affect achievement unlocking.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spirit Pursuit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wandering vengeful ghosts will attempt to capture you, testing your courage and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toy Destruction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirit-controlled dolls will try to sabotage the barrier\u2014you must act quickly to stop them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Disruptions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of minor and major disturbances keep the tension and challenge levels high.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Free Focus</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pure game-play experience that dives straight into the core fun.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modes &amp; Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faster stamina recovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one doll on the field, reducing difficulty.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers additional collection achievements for hardcore players seeking deeper satisfaction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore two distinct maps, each with unique styles and experiences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move</strong>: WADS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run</strong>: Left Shift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crouch</strong>: C</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate/Interact</strong>: Left Mouse Button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exit Investigation</strong>: Right Mouse Button</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You are an exorcist tasked with completing a ritual under the threat of malevolent spirits. This game features no narrative and plays like a hide-and-seek game with additional rules.",
